From 42cd77d323385bb3419f06329d074b2439a86dc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Feyzullah <feyzkodat@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:25:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(client): drawer replacement via rescan in cabin design

- Detect same-address drawer type changes by rescanning the cabinet
- Block replacement while the removed drawer has assignments or stock
- Re-verify on save, keep slot ids and return drawer flag

Refs #101

